僵化效果。"}],"skill":{"name":"怒放","description":"连续发射霰弹，对敌人造成伤害，并附带重伤效果。","levels":[2,5],"damage":[180.0,195.0],"cooldown":[7.5,7.5],"ailment":"重伤"}}],"number":1}],"profile":{"Age":[28],"Height":[169],"Weight":[52]},"tribes":["半精灵"],"story":"瑞秋，梦想成为海贼王的新手海贼。\n\n没人知道瑞秋是受哪一部漫画主人公影响，才梦想成为海贼。唯一能确定的是，成为不参与掠夺盗窃，而帮助有难之人的‘红玫瑰’，投身到像大海一样永无止境的冒险，是瑞秋心中一直向往的生活。虽然身着华丽的海贼服，但真正冒险却是那么遥不可及。即便如此，瑞秋还是整装待发，远山近水都是她向往的冒险之地。海贼的冒险大部分都是水上探险之旅，瑞秋一直希望成为一鸣惊人的冒险家。","storyKey":"profile_pirate_story","sources":{"hero":"heroes.json / OriginId=32","profile":"heroprofile.json / OriginId=32","strings":"strings-zhCN.json","items":"items.json / TargetCharacterIds, ExclusiveCharacterId","voiceLines":["strings-zhCN.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-enUS.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-jaJP.json / Voice_*, cv_*"]},"voiceLines":[{"id":"pirate","label":"普通","lines":[{"type":"NormalBattleWin","label":"胜利-普通战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["想赢我，你还差得～远呢。"],"enUS":["You are 100 years too early to fight me."],"jaJP":["私の相手をしようだなんて、100万年早いわ！"]},"keys":["cv_pirate_NormalBattleWin"]},{"type":"BossBattleWin","label":"胜利-首领战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["太太太太太太轻松啦！"],"enUS":["That, that was easy!"],"jaJP":["ぜ、ぜ～んぜん、余裕だったわ！"]},"keys":["cv_pirate_BossBattleWin"]},{"type":"Die","label":"阵亡","texts":{"zhCN":["为什么我总是…这样…"],"enUS":["Why am I always… like this…"],"jaJP":["どうして私は… いつもこんな…"]},"keys":["cv_pirate_Die"]},{"type":"GetExp","label":"获得经验结晶","texts":{"zhCN":["好！很好！"],"enUS":["Good, good!"],"jaJP":["いいよ、いいよ！この調子！"]},"keys":["cv_pirate_GetExp"]},{"type":"LevelUp","label":"升级","texts":{"zhCN":["什么，变得更强？这不太好吧～"],"enUS":["Well I don't want to get too strong, do I?"],"jaJP":["今より強くなっちゃうなんて、困っちゃうわぁー"]},"keys":["cv_pirate_LevelUp"]},{"type":"EquipWeapon","label":"佩戴装备","texts":{"zhCN":["非～常满意！马上开始试用！"],"enUS":["I want to go shooting right now!"],"jaJP":["いいわね、気に入ったわ！早く試してみたーい！"]},"keys":["cv_pirate_EquipWeapon"]},{"type":"EquipCostume","label":"穿戴时装","texts":{"zhCN":["太帅了！我快爱上我自己了～"],"enUS":["I'm about to fall in love with myself!"],"jaJP":["さっすが私！自分相手でも惚れちゃいそうっ！"]},"keys":["cv_pirate_EquipCostume"]},{"type":"Evolve","label":"进化","texts":{"zhCN":["世界迎来大海贼时代～！"],"enUS":["I'll be Queen of the Pirates, I'm gonna be Queen!"],"jaJP":["この世はまさに、大海賊時代を迎えたわ～！"]},"keys":["cv_pirate_Evolve"]},{"type":"Attack1","label":"攻击1","texts":{"zhCN":["哈！"],"enUS":["Haat!"],"jaJP":["はっ！"]},"keys":["cv_pirate_Attack1"]},{"type":"Attack2","label":"攻击2","texts":{"zhCN":["还不是时候！"],"enUS":["Not yet!"],"jaJP":["まだよ！"]},"keys":["cv_pirate_Attack2"]},{"type":"Attack3","label":"攻击3","texts":{"zhCN":["砰呀！"],"enUS":["Bang!"],"jaJP":["バーン！"]},"keys":["cv_pirate_Attack3"]},{"type":"Skill1","label":"技能1","texts":{"zhCN":["Double kill！"],"enUS":["Double kill!"],"jaJP":["ダブルアップ！"]},"keys":["cv_pirate_Skill1"]},{"type":"Skill2","label":"技能2","texts":{"zhCN":["去喂鱼吧！"],"enUS":["Sleep with the fishes!"],"jaJP":["魚の餌にでもなりな！"]},"keys":["cv_pirate_Skill2"]},{"type":"Damaged1","label":"受到攻击1","texts":{"zhCN":["呃！"],"enUS":["Ugh!"],"jaJP":["うっ！"]},"keys":["cv_pirate_Damaged1"]},{"type":"Damaged2","label":"受到攻击2","texts":{"zhCN":["呀！我的帽子！"],"enUS":["No! My hat!"],"jaJP":["きゃっ！私の帽子がっ！"]},"keys":["cv_pirate_Damaged2"]},{"type":"PlayerChooseBright","label":"人物友善值选项","texts":{"zhCN":["你太善良，这只会被人欺负。"],"enUS":["You're too naive. People will take advantage of you."],"jaJP":["良い子ぶったってさ、結局人に利用されるだけだよ？"]},"keys":["cv_pirate_PlayerChooseBright"]},{"type":"PlayerChooseDark","label":"人物邪恶值选项","texts":{"zhCN":["好！这才像我的伙伴！"],"enUS":["That's it! That's the correct choice, mate!"],"jaJP":["そうそう、海賊の仲間としてはそうでなくちゃ！"]},"keys":["cv_pirate_PlayerChooseDark"]},{"type":"WeakEnemyBattleStart","label":"与弱小敌人战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["哼，我对小打小闹不感兴趣…"],"enUS":["Heh, I'm not interested in small fries."],"jaJP":["ふん、ザコには興味ないわ"]},"keys":["cv_pirate_WeakEnemyBattleStart"]},{"type":"NormalEnemyBattleStart","label":"与普通敌人战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["为那些配角浪费时间，不值得！"],"enUS":["Let's not waste time with average joes."],"jaJP":["この程度の相手に、時間かけてらんないんだけど"]},"keys":["cv_pirate_NormalEnemyBattleStart"]},{"type":"StrongEnemyBattleStart","label":"与强大敌人战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["对手好强！当，当然，我还是能赢。"],"enUS":["It, it looks like it'll be a tough fight… Of, of course, I'll win!"],"jaJP":["あれ、強すぎない？も、もちろん私の相手じゃないけどね！"]},"keys":["cv_pirate_StrongEnemyBattleStart"]},{"type":"BossBattleStart","label":"与首领战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["对手也太强了吧？对...对我而言，还不算！"],"enUS":["Um… Looks like a challenge… I, I'm not afraid of anything though!"],"jaJP":["凄い強そうなのがいるね、ま、まあ私ほどじゃないけど！"]},"keys":["cv_pirate_BossBattleStart"]},{"type":"JoinParty","label":"首次加入队伍","texts":{"zhCN":["一定能掀起海贼热！"],"enUS":["The age of pirates is near!"],"jaJP":["海賊ブームは、くる！"]},"keys":["cv_pirate_JoinParty"]},{"type":"CoopAttack","label":"战斗-攻击","texts":{"zhCN":["开始射击！"],"enUS":["Open fire!"],"jaJP":["射撃開始！"]},"keys":["cv_pirate_CoopAttack"]},{"type":"CoopHeal","label":"战斗-请求治疗","texts":{"zhCN":["医生！该治疗了！"],"enUS":["Doctor! Time to heal me!"],"jaJP":["船医！治療をお願い！"]},"keys":["cv_pirate_CoopHeal"]},{"type":"CoopRun","label":"战斗-注意","texts":{"zhCN":["逃…逃走，会不会好一点？"],"enUS":["Sh-shouldn't we run?"],"jaJP":["こ、ここは退却じゃない？"]},"keys":["cv_pirate_CoopRun"]},{"type":"CoopWin","label":"战斗-胜利","texts":{"zhCN":["别忘了我的脸。"],"enUS":["Don't forget my face."],"jaJP":["私の顔、よ～く覚えておいてよ！"]},"keys":["cv_pirate_CoopWin"]},{"type":"CoopMVP","label":"战斗-最佳队员","texts":{"zhCN":["我会成为海贼王的！"],"enUS":["I'm gonna be Pirate Queen!"],"jaJP":["私は海賊の王になる女よ！"]},"keys":["cv_pirate_CoopMVP"]},{"type":"CoopHi","label":"战斗-问候","texts":{"zhCN":["你们还蛮合我心意的，请多关照！"],"enUS":["I quite like you. Let's make this work."],"jaJP":["あなたたち、私の船に乗らない？"]},"keys":["cv_pirate_CoopHi"]},{"type":"CoopHurryUp","label":"战斗-急迫","texts":{"zhCN":["走了，磨磨唧唧！"],"enUS":["Hurry or I'll leave you behind!"],"jaJP":["トロいやつは置いていくから！"]},"keys":["cv_pirate_CoopHurryUp"]},{"type":"CoopBelieve","label":"战斗-信任","texts":{"zhCN":["不用担心，我的枪是无敌的！"],"enUS":["Don't worry, my gun is invincible!"],"jaJP":["心配しないで、私の銃は無敵よ！"]},"keys":["cv_pirate_CoopBelieve"]},{"type":"TouchReactionGood1","label":"触碰反应-积极1","texts":{"zhCN":["来一杯朗姆酒吗？"],"enUS":["How about a glass of rum?"],"jaJP":["あなたもラム酒一杯、どう？"]},"keys":["Voice_pirate_1_TouchReactionGood1","cv_pirate_TouchReactionGood1"]},{"type":"TouchReactionGood2","label":"触碰反应-积极2","texts":{"zhCN":["这耳朵？哦，我母亲是精灵，父亲是人类。"],"enUS":["My ears? Well, my mother was an elf, my father a human."],"jaJP":["あ、この耳？母がエルフなの、父は人間だけど"]},"keys":["Voice_pirate_1_TouchReactionGood2","cv_pirate_TouchReactionGood2"]},{"type":"TouchReactionBad1","label":"触碰反应-消极1","texts":{"zhCN":["呃…不好意思，我有点晕。"],"enUS":["Ugh… Sorry. I have land sickness."],"jaJP":["うぇっ… ごめん、陸酔いが酷くて…"]},"keys":["Voice_pirate_1_TouchReactionBad1","cv_pirate_TouchReactionBad1"]},{"type":"TouchReactionBad2","label":"触碰反应-消极2","texts":{"zhCN":["把…把手拿开！不然我就在你头上开洞。"],"enUS":["Take that hand off or I'll… I'll blow your head off!"],"jaJP":["は、早くその手をどかさないと、頭に風穴があくわよっ！"]},"keys":["Voice_pirate_1_TouchReactionBad2","cv_pirate_TouchReactionBad2"]},{"type":"NoticeMail","label":"邮件提示","texts":{"zhCN":["书信？该不会是被通缉…了吧？"],"enUS":["New mail? It's not my bounty poster, is it?"],"jaJP":["手紙？まさか、懸賞金がかかった、なんて…？"]},"keys":["Voice_pirate_1_NoticeMail","cv_pirate_NoticeMail"]},{"type":"NoticeEvent","label":"活动提示","texts":{"zhCN":["新活动…嗯…我闻到了宝物的味道！"],"enUS":["An event… I smell treasure!"],"jaJP":["新しいイベントか… お宝の匂いがぷんぷんするね！"]},"keys":["cv_pirate_NoticeEvent"]}]}]}
